# Package manager: Bun

This project uses **Bun**, not npm or yarn.

- Install deps with `bun install`
- Run scripts with `bun run <script>` (e.g. `bun run dev`, `bun run build`)
- Add packages with `bun add` / `bun add -d`
- Prefer `bun.lock` over `package-lock.json`; do not regenerate or rely on npm lockfiles when Bun is available
- In docs and agent commands for this repo, use Bun by default
